dB+e22 |dB|^2), including the actual top Gram rows. Two deterministic full-space Krylov trial spaces are combined: the total GN-plus-stress and the stress alone. Both signs of available negative Ritz modes have their position and tangent physically scaled and are judged by the true nonlinear full objective. This model omits the floor map own second derivative and nonlinear penalty Hessians. A nonnegative Ritz value supplies no definiteness certificate.","Cut sizes in the R784 program are fixed and its finite ninth term is identified separately from an exact power-series field. R786 near-tolerance collars and full R785/R786 geometry are established only for the named fields; free iterates require their own data. No trained or sampled field is automatically an entire continuous isometry, normal-tube proof or a numerical convergence proof.","NPZs, true PLYs and full per-phase mesh details stay on the defining runner. Plain stage records retain true signed-step decision, both Ritz values, full chart diagnostics, bare candidates, whole-point and coordinate identities."],"schema":"r786-two-cap-full-domain-gram-stress-run-v1","sources":{"bent_circular_cap_field.py":"7aa3bf315a6d3ca6d0228abbbb4d60609bd057c10f001f31c1ff1205c5467ff1","bent_circular_free_ring_fields.py":"d6e0540fe3d52ed71f11b44eeafec7501a9aea1188ba73334322c201f45ba748","bent_circular_free_ring_system.py":"cb625e3e70923bd349434e358fbfca86dc715392147eacad23e38aa5ebd9f451","bent_coherent_shear_fields.py":"57382dffa48bcb487282e0f4bad96553bad23d70e4e623712722108abf9c5906","bent_mild_cap_pullback_fields.py":"b9efe959aa574cb77c3f2cdd3748cbd28dfe544fc5c0e83350c2285f14944cf5","bent_mild_cap_stress_phase.py":"f8e24b72c67a766fe9e3d38bcaa9ab945ffc7db45bc438ac1d6e39e2626a83ae","bent_mild_cap_stress_system.py":"51e2852875151d47b73a23e71f6507f05090b63b447db6f499c3e766066af78c","bent_preloaded_bridge_system.py":"507c6a8036b9a86b32b3477a0b7f7622382f134239f47d82a5758f598b1d23ba","bent_spatial_ring_fields.py":"57f00eb13e1729c313